  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add a section in the action menu that lets users create local \"markers\" or \"checkpoints\" sort of in different worlds to mark their location so they can remember where said location is later or in general just to mark an area of interest. Users would be able to toggle whether or not they want to see them through the action menu, like perhaps maybe setting it so they see them automatically, only see them when they have the launch pad menu open, or not at all. Users wouldn't be able to teleport to them nor would there be a path to show how to get back to said markers, and world creators could have a setting to turn off the ability to set markers in their worlds. Users would be able customize markers with different colors, names, and provided symbols.",
